          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Custom engagement rings, personal jewelry and objects.</p><p>Each commission is guided end to end, from initial consultation to final delivery </p><p>and follows a defined design process, with a limited number accepted each month.</p><p><br/><a href=\"mailto:info@lloydsteven.com\" title=\"mailto:info@lloydsteven.com\"><strong>REQUEST AN APPOINTMENT</strong></a></p>"
