    "multirow_9fJdVY": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_XJfEE6": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Lloyd_14_d420cf44-ad09-45e5-b050-2d25d7bf47b8.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h2>DAILY WEAR<br/></h2><p>Lloyd Steven jewellery is heirloom quality and will age beautifully with proper care.</p><p>To best care for your piece we recommend removing before:</p><ul><li>Exercise or sport<br/></li><li>Swimming (chlorine & salt can damage metals)<br/></li><li>Heavy lifting<br/></li><li>Applying lotions, perfume, or hair products<br/></li><li>Sleeping, where chains and claws can catch<br/></li></ul><p>Impact is the most common cause of stone loosening. </p><p>When in doubt, take it off.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_PBefte": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-12-18_at_11.00.35_am_a9931c2c-cded-4453-b85e-f03e09db4ea3.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h2>CLEANING </h2><p>To restore brilliance at home:</p><ol><li>Soak in warm water with a small amount of mild dish soap.<br/></li><li>Gently brush with a soft toothbrush.<br/></li><li>Rinse thoroughly and pat dry with a lint-free cloth.<br/></li></ol><p>Avoid ultrasonic cleaners unless approved, some stones require specialised care.</p><p>For a professional clean and inspection, we recommend periodic servicing. </p><p>Please contact the studio to arrange your servicing. </p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_yRtciC": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/N6A7227.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h2>Storage + Travel</h2><p>When not wearing your piece:</p><ul><li>Store it in its Lloyd Steven box or pouch<br/></li><li>Keep items separate to prevent scratching<br/></li><li>Avoid humid environments like bathrooms<br/></li></ul><p>Chains should be fastened to prevent tangling.</p><p>Jewellery is safest when carried with you, not in checked luggage. Use individual pouches and avoid letting pieces rub together.<br/></p><p></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
