    "multirow_4qXczU": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_nrYAyF": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/N6A4769_fd71465d-1ac3-41cc-947f-0b5274db7f50.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h2>Servicing + Repairs</h2><p>Even beautifully made jewellery benefits from maintenance.</p><p>We suggest an inspection every 12 months to check:</p><ul><li>Stone security<br/></li><li>Claw wear<br/></li><li>Clasps and fittings<br/></li><li>Chain integrity<br/></li></ul><p>If something feels different, sounds loose, or has taken a knock, stop wearing it and contact us.</p><p>We will clean, service, resize, and restore your piece.</p><p></p><p><a href=\"mailto:info@lloydsteven.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@lloydsteven.com\">ARRANGE A SERVICING</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_ij3P4i": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/N6A4769_fd71465d-1ac3-41cc-947f-0b5274db7f50.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h2>WARRANTY</h2><p>Lloyd Steven offers a warranty against manufacturing faults under normal wear.</p><p>This does not cover:</p><ul><li>Accidental damage<br/></li><li>Impact<br/></li><li>General wear and tear<br/></li><li>Loss or theft<br/></li><li>Unauthorised repair or modification<br/></li></ul><p>If you believe your piece has a fault, contact us and our team will guide the next steps.</p><p></p><p><a href=\"mailto:info@lloydsteven.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@lloydsteven.com\">CONTACT STUDIO</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
